      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There is established the Policy Planning Council which shall consist of the Mayor, the Deputy Mayor, the Deputy Mayor City Administrator, the Chairman of the City Planning Commission, and the Director of the Budget. The Mayor shall be Chairman of the Policy Planning Council and the Council shall meet at his call.",
