      "text": "\u00a7 2. The Council shall designate such personnel of the agencies under the direction of its respective members as it may deem necessary to serve as its staff, and the Mayor shall designate an executive director who shall be in charge and control of the matters assigned to said staff and shall report to the Mayor and to the Council with respect thereto. Subject to applicable provisions of law, the Council may retain consultants.",
